 "words_heard": 224,
 "words": 226,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Mama kept her Bible on the windowsill by the sink",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 9.02,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Pages soft as flour sacks and underlined in pencil ink",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 8.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "She said, child, when the road forks and you don't know where to go",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 7.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a word I want you holding more than anything you know",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 2.28,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Trust in the LORD with all your heart",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And do not lean on your own understanding",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.2,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In all your ways acknowledge him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And he will make your paths straight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I've been lost on county highways with a map across my knee",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sure that I was smart enough to find the way for me",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the roads I chose kept winding and the dust got in my eyes",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Till I pulled off on the shoulder and I let go of my pride",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trust in the LORD with all your heart",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And do not lean on your own understanding",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.39,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In all your ways acknowledge him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he will make your paths straight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be wise in your own eyes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Fear the LORD and turn away from evil",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.65,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Bind them around your neck",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Write them on the tablet of your heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
